{"id":"6HmM6fEBRxHhxxak","meta":{"instanceId":"f6feb7008ea9ae15c03acdb184c56b00afb5d170c7df4a5f5b2d30116c1382f2","templateCredsSetupCompleted":true},"name":"Tenant Reference Verification & Screening Automation","tags":[],"nodes":[{"id":"581b54c8-a9ba-412d-bc2e-a53facfe8352","name":"Sticky Note","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-176,32],"parameters":{"width":480,"height":896,"content":"## Tenant Reference Verification & Screening Automation\n\n### How it works\n\nThis workflow automates tenant reference verification from applicant intake through landlord follow-up and escalation. It creates a pending tracking record, emails the landlord for a reference, waits and checks whether the request is still pending, then sends reminders and notifies the agent as needed. A separate landlord feedback form updates the record and backs up the raw response, while a scheduled scan escalates overdue pending references after 49 hours.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Connect Google Sheets credentials and configure each Sheets node with the correct spreadsheet, worksheet, lookup keys, and status columns.\n- Configure the applicant intake and landlord feedback forms so their fields match the sheet columns and email template variables.\n- Connect email/Gmail credentials for landlord requests, reminder emails, agent alerts, and failure notifications.\n- Set the Wait node duration and Schedule Trigger frequency to match the desired reminder and escalation timing.\n- Review recipient addresses, subject lines, and message bodies for all email nodes before activating the workflow.\n\n### Customization\n\nYou can adjust the pending, reminder-sent, responded, and escalated statuses, change the reminder delay or 49-hour escalation threshold, and tailor the email templates for different rental processes."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"d4f40609-f9d2-4362-9584-a564bad89d28","name":"Sticky Note1","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[384,96],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":512,"height":672,"content":"## Applicant intake tracking\n\nCaptures a new applicant submission, creates the initial pending record in Google Sheets, and sends an alert if the sheet write fails."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"90959f44-364f-4a06-922f-d37ef781906b","name":"Sticky Note2","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[1232,32],"parameters":{"color":7,"height":736,"content":"## Landlord request email\n\nSends the initial reference request to the landlord and triggers a failure alert if that outbound email cannot be sent."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"7ac18d3e-1a2a-4c6f-b299-e1fca6411785","name":"Sticky Note3","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[1888,96],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":832,"height":304,"content":"## Delayed pending recheck\n\nWaits after the initial request, retrieves the applicant row again, and checks whether the reference request is still pending."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"2d6784ef-1e74-4034-86da-21cddc4e3910","name":"Sticky Note4","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[2864,80],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":832,"height":304,"content":"## Reminder and agent notice\n\nIf the request remains pending, sends a reminder to the landlord, updates the sheet status, and notifies the agent."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"1c43a99b-cb46-455d-b731-cf24262b75af","name":"Sticky Note5","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[384,944],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":592,"height":624,"content":"## Landlord response logging\n\nReceives landlord feedback, marks the applicant record as responded, and stores a raw backup of the submitted response."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"4e3cef85-30ee-489e-a858-2ef4c3898df8","name":"Sticky Note6","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[352,1776],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":912,"height":304,"content":"## Scheduled overdue scan\n\nRuns on a schedule, retrieves pending rows, and checks which requests have exceeded the 49-hour overdue threshold."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"5004d146-534d-4c58-80c7-a9d8e3d8f9fc","name":"Sticky Note7","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[1552,1760],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":624,"height":304,"content":"## Escalation handling\n\nEmails the agent about overdue pending references and updates the sheet status to escalated."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"c7652baf-1cf9-429a-af12-c588a4353930","name":"When Form Submitted","type":"n8n-nodes-base.formTrigger","position":[432,256],"webhookId":"196c6d8b-1a78-4c83-8cb1-c7b3a74d1614","parameters":{"options":{},"formTitle":"Tenant Reference Request","formFields":{"values":[{"fieldLabel":"Applicant Name","requiredField":true},{"fieldType":"email","fieldLabel":"Previous Landlord / Letting Agent Email","requiredField":true},{"fieldType":"email","fieldLabel":"Agent Email","requiredField":true},{"fieldLabel":"Property Address / Unit Number","requiredField":true}]},"formDescription":"Please complete this form to request a rental reference for a prospective tenant. All fields are required."},"typeVersion":2.6},{"id":"37d8b20a-9fb8-4967-9093-6ab3df2609c3","name":"Append to Tenant Tracker","type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets","onError":"continueErrorOutput","position":[752,256],"parameters":{"operation":"append","sheetName":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":"","cachedResultUrl":"","cachedResultName":""},"documentId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":"","cachedResultUrl":"","cachedResultName":"Tenant Reference Tracker"}},"typeVersion":4.7},{"id":"491ad57d-a60b-4845-bf63-61c729bf8773","name":"Email Reference Request","type":"n8n-nodes-base.emailSend","onError":"continueErrorOutput","position":[1296,240],"webhookId":"62a8c87f-2a5e-4fd5-846e-fd2fe7ed9c1a","parameters":{"html":"=<p>Hello,</p>\n<p>A reference request has been submitted for the property at <strong>{{ $json['Property Address'] }}</strong> regarding applicant <strong>{{ $json['Applicant Name'] }}</strong>.</p>\n<p>Please complete the reference form by clicking the link below:</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://YOUR-N8N-DOMAIN/form/REPLACE-WITH-LANDLORD-FEEDBACK